                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is a lot of fun!! I beat all of the levels and am aiming to get an expert score on all of them next. Not sure about the reviews saying level 10 is impossible to beat but as someone who has beaten it and all of the other levels I can confirm this isn't true. My only complaint is that it saves locally and not to the cloud and I had to hard reset my computer twice over the course of my playthroughs. I wish I had known the first time but the second time was on me lol. If you're looking for a challenge that involves strategy I recommend this game (and all of the other diner dash games if you can get your hands on them). I played the original Diner Dash on my grandma's computer when I was 10 years old and wish they had more here on Steam. Also if you couldn't already tell from the main reason why this game is thumbs downed, it needs to be played in windowed mode, which I had no issue with.",
